Table full name: US_REAL_ESTATE.CYBERSYN.POINT_OF_INTEREST_INDEX
Column name: CATEGORY_MAIN Type: TEXT Description: Primary category or class of place for the POI.
Column name: POI_NAME Type: TEXT Description: Name of the place, merchant, or landmark for the particular the POI.
Column name: CATEGORY_ALTERNATE Type: ARRAY Description: Alternate categories of the POI. A POI could fit multiple categories (e.g., Restaurant, Burger Restaurant, Fast Food Restaurant), in which case one category would be recorded as CATEGORY_MAIN and the remaining categories would be recorded in a list under CATEGORY_ALTERNATE.
Column name: POI_ID Type: TEXT Description: A unique identifier for a point of interest (such as a park, fast food chain, hotel, etc.) based on its description and location. This is joinable to the POINT_OF_INTEREST_ADDRESSES_RELATIONSHIPS table which can be used to link POIs to addresses.
Sample rows:
[{'POI_ID': '08f26c862279d1150352e1060f847671', 'POI_NAME': 'Redbox', 'CATEGORY_MAIN': 'Video And Video Game Rentals', 'CATEGORY_ALTERNATE': '[\n  "Books Mags Music And Video",\n  "Rental Kiosks"\n]'}, {'POI_ID': '08f27490544e86b1036967efcd70720e', 'POI_NAME': 'Hudson Place', 'CATEGORY_MAIN': 'Retirement Home', 'CATEGORY_ALTERNATE': '[\n  "Health And Medical",\n  "Public Service And Government"\n]'}, {'POI_ID': '08f275d740d8184e03d67542272d1020', 'POI_NAME': 'One Source Construction Corp.', 'CATEGORY_MAIN': 'Construction Services', 'CATEGORY_ALTERNATE': '[\n  "Commercial Industrial",\n  "Contractor"\n]'}, {'POI_ID': '08f26c18910da49303ca27a9af04b9cf', 'POI_NAME': 'Council Road', 'CATEGORY_MAIN': 'Church Cathedral', 'CATEGORY_ALTERNATE': '[\n  "Baptist Church",\n  "Religious Organization"\n]'}, {'POI_ID': '08f2a94d0592d19c0352b1ade5f7bfe8', 'POI_NAME': 'Impact Employment Solutions', 'CATEGORY_MAIN': 'Employment Agencies', 'CATEGORY_ALTERNATE': '[\n  "Information Technology Company",\n  "Professional Services"\n]'}]

