Table full name: US_REAL_ESTATE.CYBERSYN.USPS_ADDRESS_CHANGE_ATTRIBUTES
Column name: VARIABLE_NAME Type: TEXT Description: A human-readable description of the variable
Column name: UNIT Type: TEXT Description: Unit of measurement, which is the count of address change requests
Column name: REQUEST_TYPE Type: TEXT Description: Categorization of request. Request types are grouped as temporal (permanent or temporary); requestor type (family, individual, business); or total
Column name: MEASURE Type: TEXT Description: Type of address changes being reported, Inbound - people moving to the geography; outbound - people leaving the geography; net - inbound less outbound
Column name: FREQUENCY Type: TEXT Description: Frequency for which the value is reported
Column name: VARIABLE Type: TEXT Description: A unique identifier joinable to the timeseries table
Sample rows:
[{'VARIABLE': 'inbound_address_changes_permanent', 'VARIABLE_NAME': 'Inbound Address Changes, Permanent', 'MEASURE': 'Inbound Address Changes', 'REQUEST_TYPE': 'Permanent', 'UNIT': 'Count', 'FREQUENCY': 'Month'}, {'VARIABLE': 'inbound_address_changes_total', 'VARIABLE_NAME': 'Inbound Address Changes, Total', 'MEASURE': 'Inbound Address Changes', 'REQUEST_TYPE': 'Total', 'UNIT': 'Count', 'FREQUENCY': 'Month'}, {'VARIABLE': 'inbound_address_changes_businesses', 'VARIABLE_NAME': 'Inbound Address Changes, Businesses', 'MEASURE': 'Inbound Address Changes', 'REQUEST_TYPE': 'Businesses', 'UNIT': 'Count', 'FREQUENCY': 'Month'}, {'VARIABLE': 'net_address_changes_individuals', 'VARIABLE_NAME': 'Net Address Changes, Individuals', 'MEASURE': 'Net Address Changes', 'REQUEST_TYPE': 'Individuals', 'UNIT': 'Count', 'FREQUENCY': 'Month'}, {'VARIABLE': 'outbound_address_changes_temporary', 'VARIABLE_NAME': 'Outbound Address Changes, Temporary', 'MEASURE': 'Outbound Address Changes', 'REQUEST_TYPE': 'Temporary', 'UNIT': 'Count', 'FREQUENCY': 'Month'}]

