Table full name: US_REAL_ESTATE.CYBERSYN.USPS_ADDRESS_CHANGE_TIMESERIES
Column name: VARIABLE_NAME Type: TEXT Description: A human readable description of the variable
Column name: DATE Type: DATE Description: Date corresponding to data point. Note that dates are recorded as the period end date when measurement period is >1 day
Column name: VARIABLE Type: TEXT Description: A unique identifier joinable to the attributes table
Column name: GEO_NAME Type: TEXT Description: Location name of the state, city, or zip code
Column name: GEO_ID Type: TEXT Description: A unique identifier for a place (e.g., state, city, zip-code, etc.). Joinable to the geography_index/relationships tables for filtering region aggregation
Column name: VALUE Type: NUMBER Description: The numeric value of the reported variable
